{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55439","headline":"题天申宫三首 三 · 宋维","name":"题天申宫三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云岚满袖倚嵓扉，龙窟寒生夜睡迟。\n一曲朱弦谁与听，月斜风撼碧桃枝。\n（见洪武刻本《咸淳毘陵志》卷二十二，嘉庆二年刊宁楷等纂《宜兴县志》卷十收第一首。\n）（按：《四库全书》本《江南通志》卷一一九录宋乾德进士有宋维。\n疑维初居江南，後北上应试。\n《毘陵志》归南唐，今从之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}